  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-07-17T09:04:11.617Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Panic mode would be a useful feature if we could toggle it on and off again. \nRight now, we can only toggle it on, which resets all our custom safety settings, so to turn it off again we need to spend a lot of time restoring our previous settings. This is frustrating and stops us from ever using the panic mode even when needed. \nPlease make the panic mode something that does not affect the custom safety settings, and that goes back to the previous state when toggled off again.",
